      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.1881103515625,
        513.46044921875,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "with HIV, and is therefore not representative of the situation in 2013. Finally, that study",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18463134765625,
        513.4144897460938,
        112.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "was stopped early, following interim analysis. There was also an acknowledged difficulty",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        115.18115234375,
        513.4259033203125,
        128.53265380859375
      ],
      "text": "in interpreting that study: the reduced mortality reported was not a reduction in deaths",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        131.17767333984375,
        214.09239196777344,
        144.5291748046875
      ],
      "text": "attributed primarily to TB.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        155.68414306640625,
        513.4608764648438,
        169.04364013671875
      ],
      "text": "A recent publication (Frigati et al., 2011 ) that was reviewed was an observational cohort  3",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03990173339844,
        171.68865966796875,
        513.4036254882812,
        185.0401611328125
      ],
      "text": "study of the survivors of the original trial, all started on IPT and with ART introduced",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03990173339844,
        187.6851806640625,
        513.4265747070312,
        201.03668212890625
      ],
      "text": "over time. IPT was reported as providing benefit additional to that of ART in protecting",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03990173339844,
        203.68170166015625,
        513.4235229492188,
        217.04364013671875
      ],
      "text": "against TB, but the quality of evidence was considered low because of study design and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        219.68865966796875,
        279.9388427734375,
        233.0401611328125
      ],
      "text": "other confounders changing over time.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        244.19512939453125,
        513.3889770507812,
        257.546630859375
      ],
      "text": "These findings were discussed in a subsequent conference call between the Panel of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        260.1226501464844,
        513.3892211914062,
        273.54315185546875
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines for intensified case-finding for  this guidance and the Panel of the 2011",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        276.1191711425781,
        510.2724914550781,
        289.5396728515625
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis and isoniazid preventive therapy for people living with HIV in resource-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        292.1156921386719,
        189.1923828125,
        305.53619384765625
      ],
      "text": "constrained settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        316.69122314453125,
        513.43505859375,
        330.042724609375
      ],
      "text": "During the conference call with the two panels, it was agreed to split the recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        332.6877136230469,
        513.4119262695312,
        346.0392150878906
      ],
      "text": "for two different settings (settings with a high TB prevalence and settings with a medium",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        348.6842041015625,
        196.65589904785156,
        362.03570556640625
      ],
      "text": "or low TB prevalence).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        373.1907043457031,
        513.4696044921875,
        386.5422058105469
      ],
      "text": "In high TB prevalence settings, 6 months of IPT may have additional benefits to that of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        389.18719482421875,
        513.3660278320312,
        402.5386962890625
      ],
      "text": "ART in protecting against TB. However, in settings with a medium to low prevalence of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        405.1836853027344,
        513.4694213867188,
        418.5351867675781
      ],
      "text": "TB, IPT might be offered considering resource implications. The Panel recommended",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        421.18017578125,
        222.41586303710938,
        434.53167724609375
      ],
      "text": "further research in this area.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        445.4106750488281,
        161.71890258789062,
        459.0381774902344
      ],
      "text": "Panel decision",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        464.523681640625,
        513.4349975585938,
        477.87518310546875
      ],
      "text": "Split the recommendation into two separate recommendations for the two different",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        480.5201721191406,
        180.88938903808594,
        493.8716735839844
      ],
      "text": "settings as follows:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03689575195312,
        507.545166015625,
        213.58389282226562,
        521.1726684570312
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 25 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88489532470703,
        532.3506469726562,
        513.4692993164062,
        545.9781494140625
      ],
      "text": "Children living with HIV who are more than 12 months of age and who are",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88489532470703,
        546.1506958007812,
        510.20330810546875,
        559.7781982421875
      ],
      "text": "unlikely to have TB disease on symptom-based screening and have no con-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88489532470703,
        559.9506225585938,
        207.0519256591797,
        573.578125
      ],
      "text": "tact with a TB case:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        579.9029541015625,
        510.2952575683594,
        594.1229248046875
      ],
      "text": "should be offered 6 months of IPT (10 mg/kg per day, range 7–15 mg/ -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03939819335938,
        594.3029174804688,
        513.5714111328125,
        608.5228881835938
      ],
      "text": "kg, maximum dose 300 mg/day) as part of a comprehensive package",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03939819335938,
        608.7029418945312,
        513.5834350585938,
        622.9229125976562
      ],
      "text": "of HIV prevention and care services if living in settings with a high TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03939819335938,
        623.1029052734375,
        182.17938232421875,
        637.3228759765625
      ],
      "text": "prevalence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        642.6464233398438,
        347.8393859863281,
        655.9979248046875
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        662.302978515625,
        510.1634826660156,
        676.52294921875
      ],
      "text": "might be offered 6 months of IPT (10 mg/kg per day, range 7–15 mg/ -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03939819335938,
        676.7029418945312,
        513.5714111328125,
        690.9229125976562
      ],
      "text": "kg, maximum dose 300 mg/day) as part of a comprehensive package",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03939819335938,
        691.1029052734375,
        513.559326171875,
        705.3228759765625
      ],
      "text": "of HIV prevention and care services if living in settings with a medium",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        121.03939819335938,
        705.5029296875,
        239.52737426757812,
        719.722900390625
      ],
      "text": "or low TB prevalence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        725.04638671875,
        513.4050903320312,
        738.3978881835938
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation acknowledging resource implications, low quality of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        738.846435546875,
        148.889404296875,
        752.1979370117188
      ],
      "text": "evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        779.2048950195312,
        512.5126342773438,
        791.2048950195312
      ],
      "text": "Frigati LJ et al. The impact of isoniazid preventive therapy and antiretroviral therapy on tuberculosis in children infected  3",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21649932861328,
        788.8048706054688,
